                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Drug Facts</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Active ingredient (in each dose)     Purpose</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Polyethylene Glycol 3350, USP, 17 g . . . . . . . . . Osmotic Laxative</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Use</paragraph>
                  <list listType="unordered">
                     <item>
                        <caption>▪</caption>relieves occasional constipation (irregularity)</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>▪</caption>generally produces a bowel movement in 1 to 3 days</item>
                  </list>
